      "templates": "extract('extract_templates.py', out/'templates.json', KEYS={'empty', 'switch_mode_restart_fsm'})",
      "installedTextAssets": [
        "Use unity_assets.bundle(path)[0] to find the matching CAB and unity_assets.serialized(cabBytes)[\"objects\"] to select the PathId with classid=49.",
        "Slice cabBytes[start:start+size] and check both hashes. Offsets are relative to the complete Unity TextAsset object.",
        "For a recorded table T and slot S, read V=T−i32(T) and F=T+u16(V+4+2*S), with a zero/absent vtable entry indicating the default value. Follow offsets with P+u32(P); a vector at its resulting location starts with its u32 count and then uoffsets. A string starts with a u32 byte count and uses UTF-8.",
        "Rogue display table slots 0/1 identify id/name. Rune-data slots 0/1 identify id and rune vector, rune slots 0/1 identify key and blackboard vector, blackboard slots 0/1/2 identify key/float value/string value.",
        "Boss Rush rune-data slots 0/4 identify id and rune vector; rune slots 0/1/2 identify key, selector table and blackboard vector; selector slot 0 is the profession mask.",
        "Weedy skill table slots 0/3 identify id and skill-level vector, level slots 6/8 identify id and blackboard vector."
      ],
